{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/hwbqtkby","slide":2,"text":"Explain the backbone before the algorithms. The same corpus is searched through a lexical channel and an embedding channel. Rank fusion combines ordering rather than incompatible raw score scales. Anthropic labels the lexical branch TF-IDF in this visual; the lesson implements BM25 as the stronger lexical baseline.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/contextual-retrieval"}
