{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slide":7,"text":"Anthropic reports average failed retrievals at top 20 falling from 5.7% for embeddings alone to 1.9% for reranked contextual embeddings plus contextual BM25. This is evidence for the architecture, not a promise that every corpus will obtain the same result.\n\n[Sources]\n- https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/contextual-retrieval"}
